                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Prioritize features based on customer value, business impact, effort, and strategic importance.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Use iterative development and customer feedback to improve the product throughout development.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

