                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Customer Engagement:</b> Track usage frequency, feature engagement, and customer interaction.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Retention:</b> Monitor customer retention, renewal, and long-term product usage.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Revenue Performance:</b> Evaluate revenue growth, customer value, and profitability throughout the product lifecycle.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Product Quality:</b> Monitor defects, reliability, performance, support requirements, and customer satisfaction.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Innovation Performance:</b> Measure the impact of new features, enhancements, and product improvements.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Lifecycle Efficiency:</b> Evaluate development speed, operational costs, resource utilization, and overall product efficiency.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

